---
layout: base.njk
title: About
---
<section class="about-section wrap">
  <h1>About</h1>
  <p>Lava Lamp Magazine is the collaboration of bright minds passionate about good stories. A creative non-fiction magazine created by students at the American University in Bulgaria.</p>
  <p>It began as passionate discussions about quality writing, print media, and meaningful stories, evolved into an independent study, advised by Professor Laura Kelly, and is now a growing publication with a wide range of contributors.</p>
  <p>Although Lava Lamp started as an independent study at American University in Bulgaria, here in our digital space, you can enjoy the collaborative work of writers, illustrators, and photographers, who try to captivate readers with vivid language, unique perspectives, and genuine passion for their work.</p>
</section>

<section class="team-section wrap">
  <div class="team-list">
    {%- for member in team.members %}
    {%- set authorRec = member.author | findAuthor(collections.authors) -%}
    <div class="team-member">
      {% if authorRec.data.photo %}
      <div class="ph-image square"><a href="{{ authorRec.url }}"><img src="{{ authorRec.data.photo }}" alt=""></a></div>
      {% else %}
      <div class="ph square"><span>Photo</span></div>
      {% endif %}
      <h3>{% if authorRec %}<a href="{{ authorRec.url }}">{{ member.name }}</a>{% else %}{{ member.name }}{% endif %}</h3>
      <p class="role">{{ member.role }}</p>
      <p>{{ member.bio }}</p>
    </div>
    {%- endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

{% if collections.authors.length %}
<section class="authors-section wrap">
  <p class="eyebrow">Contributors</p>
  <div class="authors-grid">
    {%- for author in collections.authors %}
    <a href="{{ author.url }}" class="author-tile">
      {% if author.data.photo %}
      <div class="ph-image square"><img src="{{ author.data.photo }}" alt=""></div>
      {% else %}
      <div class="ph square"><span>Author photo</span></div>
      {% endif %}
      <h3>{{ author.data.name }}</h3>
      <p class="role">{{ author.data.role or "Author" }}</p>
    </a>
    {%- endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
{% endif %}
